{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297650","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297650","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1029765001:1":{"text":"よほほほっ！お前さんたちのおかげで、職人たちは大忙しだ！","source_cn":"嚯嚯嚯，托你们的福，这些日子铁匠们可是忙得团团转！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DDA795CA0605FEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029765002:1":{"text":"店や旅行客が一気に増えてな。祭典の時といい勝負だよ！","source_cn":"到处都是商铺和游客，比祭典那会儿都不差多少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10E1E9B5CE60EFB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029765003:1":{"text":"ほんと、ほんと。旅館も毎日お客さんがひっきりなしさ！","source_cn":"可不是，旅馆的客人也是一拨接着一拨，天天客满啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B6BBA7028370C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029765004:1":{"text":"けど、中には文句を言ってるお客さんもいたねえ。なんでも、道中が面倒だとかなんとか……","source_cn":"只不过我听着客人们聊天，发现里头有不少人都在抱怨，说路...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5860F63E47625F40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029765004":{"text":"けど、中には文句を言ってるお客さんもいたねえ。なんでも、道中が面倒だとかなんとか……","source_cn":"只不过我听着客人们聊天，发现里头有不少人都在抱怨，说路上太麻烦了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5860F63E47625F40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029765005:1":{"text":"ウチには観光客だけじゃなくて、商人も泊まるからね。","source_cn":"嗯，来旅店住宿的不仅是游客，有不少都是送货的商人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9155A4B5EDF589E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029765006:1":{"text":"ババリアの商人たちが、ここで武器や部品を買ったら、一度聖石町を経由しないといけないって言ってたべ。","source_cn":"那些蛮血商人说，他们在这边采购了武器零件什么的，总得回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD473A003E613261","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029765007:1":{"text":"遠回りになるだけじゃなくて、聖石町の検査は特に厳しいから、一回の仕入れにかなり時間がかかるって愚痴ってたねえ。","source_cn":"绕路不说，圣石镇那边的审查又特别严格，一来一回浪费不少时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5818F179F8D0BE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029765008:1":{"text":"そうそう。ロドリゴさんとも話したんだが、こっちでも似たような苦情が多かったそうだ。","source_cn":"是啊，和罗德里戈聊了聊，发现雪松镇这边类似的抱怨和请愿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFA3E92A2213F997","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029765009:1":{"text":"できればスノーシダー町と荒涼の砂漠――つまりウール族の集落と直接行き来したいと言ってたぞ。","source_cn":"他们都希望能让雪松镇与荒角沙漠——乌尔氏族的人直接往来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x576BD44CB96271D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029765010:1":{"text":"それが叶えば、ババリアの旅行客ももっと増えるんじゃないか？","source_cn":"要是能建立直接往来的通道，估计蛮血的游客也会增加不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2051152A1F4727C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029765011:1":{"text":"ふん、喧嘩しか能がないあんぽんたんどもは正直好きじゃないけど、アイツら、遊びに関しては豪快だからねえ。","source_cn":"哼，我是不喜欢那些只会打架的笨蛋，不过嘛，他们吃喝玩乐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x068E7C473E47F76E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029765012:1":{"text":"まだ誰も挑戦したことのないウチの旅館の超高温風呂も、アイツらの分厚い毛皮なら耐えられるかもしれないねえ！","source_cn":"我的温泉里还有没人敢挑战的超高温，最适合那帮笨蛋的厚皮毛了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x419AC3765C594EBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029765013:0":{"text":"それはいい提案だと思う。地図を確認したけど、ルートや商品も特に問題はなさそうだ。","source_cn":"很好的想法，我刚刚看了看地图，路线和商品都能保证。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x679373EE8D9B4673","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029765014:0":{"text":"両方の承諾さえ取れれば、新しい拠点を建てなくても、実現可能だと思うよ。","source_cn":"只需要取得两个地方的许可，用现有的贸易站就完全能够实行了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71479DE4FF772648","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen